<title>CANADA: Cineplex locks out projectionists - union.</title>
<headline>Cineplex locks out projectionists - union.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ontario Motion Picture Projectionists (union) said Cineplex Odeon Corp locked out 90 projectionists in theatres across Ontario.</p>
<p>The union said Cineplex locked them out to back the company's demand that the projectionists accept a cut in income.</p>
<p>The union called for a boycott of Cineplex theatres.</p>
<p>Cineplex said alternate personnel would staff the more than 200 theaters in the absence of the union members and that it was seeking to re-define the role of the projectionist.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
